{"t":"MO","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Altria Group, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Tobacco","employees":5900,"hq":"Richmond, VA, United States","website":"https://www.altria.com","summary_en":"Altria Group, Inc., through its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells smokeable and oral tobacco products in the United States. It offers cigarettes primarily under the Marlboro brand; large cigars and pipe tobacco under the Black & Mild brand; moist smokeless tobacco and oral tobacco products under the Copenhagen, Skoal, Red Seal, and Husky brands; oral nicotine pouches under the on! brand; and e-vapor products under the NJOY ACE brand. The company sells its products to distributors, as well as large retail organizations, such as chain stores. Altria Group, Inc. was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Altria Group, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국에서 흡연 가능 및 경구용 담배 제품을 제조 및 판매합니다. 주로 말보로 브랜드로 담배를 제공합니다. Black & Mild 브랜드의 대형 시가 및 파이프 담배; Copenhagen, Skoal, Red Seal 및 Husky 브랜드의 촉촉한 무연 담배 및 경구용 담배 제품; 위에 아래에 구강 니코틴 파우치가 있습니다! 상표; NJOY ACE 브랜드의 e-vapor 제품도 있습니다. 회사는 유통업체는 물론 체인점과 같은 대규모 소매 조직에 제품을 판매합니다. Altria Group, Inc.는 1822년에 설립되었으며 버지니아주 리치먼드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":77.58,"mcap":129049436160.0,"pe":15.995877,"fpe":13.100283,"peg":2.9889,"ps":6.2542133,"pb":-58.025433,"ev_ebitda":11.698,"div":5.72,"beta":0.463,"hi52":79.87,"lo52":54.7},"fin":{"rev":20633999360.0,"rev_g":0.036,"eps_g":0.067,"gross":0.72433996,"op":0.61478,"net":0.39333,"roe":null,"fcf":7057249792.0,"cash":2696999936.0,"debt":24060999680.0,"de":null,"eps":4.85,"feps":5.92201},"own":{"short":0.024,"inst":0.65185,"insider":0.00117},"analyst":{"n":11,"mean":73.45455,"median":73.0,"high":85.0,"low":59.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.64286,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":4,"hold":8,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","str